==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*1 [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)|Kagamine Rin & Len]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[MikuBear]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Focus on killing the Dagshund with Cats like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]]. After it's dead, the stage will be easy due to Kagamine Rin & Len's blind spot and the MikuBear's lack of Area Attack.

